 "moshi_text": "Hi, how is your day? Alright. I've got some fruits that are very popular. Let's start with apples. They're known for their sweet taste and are consumed in many ways. What? Sure. Let's move on to citrus fruits. Lemons, limes, oranges, and grapefruits are all great options. Do you have a favorite? Great. We've got some fragrant spices here. Cloves, garlic, ginger, and cinnamon are just a few examples. What's your favorite? Oh, I love them too. Let's see if we can name them all quickly. Banana, blueberry, blackberry, raspberry, nectarine. And we can't forget about the beautiful flowers. Rose, lavender, lily, and daffodil are all beautiful and fragrant. Do you have a favorite? Great. We've got plenty of fruits and vegetables to name. Let's keep it going. What's your next guess? Oh, I love kiwis. They're a great option and come with lots of health benefits.",
